<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>
<p>You’ve been invited to <%= @retrospective.title %><% if @retrospective.sprint_label.present? %> (<%= @retrospective.sprint_label %>)<% end %> on <%= @retrospective.team.name %>.</p>
<p>Open the link while signed in as <%= @user.email %>. This invitation does not work for any other account.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Open retrospective", @url %></p>
<p>The link expires in 14 days and only works while notes are being collected.</p>
